---
source: crates/qrec-core/src/keymap.rs
expression: text
---
Idle: r record · o record over · s split · c autocut · ? all keys
Countdown: Esc cancel · r cancel
Recording: r stop · Esc cancel take (files kept) · Tab switch view · = - zoom · \ fit
Finalizing: finalizing the take, waiting for every file to close (up to 10 s) · d discard it · Tab switch view · = - zoom
ClipSelected: s split · [ ] trim to playhead · < > move · x remove · c autocut · o record over · z zoom to clip · ? all keys
Dragging: release to apply · Esc cancel drag · n snapping on/off
